---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Guestbook — MyDev" description="通过 GitHub 加入 MyDev 公开留言板。">
  <header class="page-head contact-head"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> Public channel / GitHub Discussions</p><h1>Leave a signal.</h1><p>使用 GitHub 账号登录后即可公开留言、回复讨论或留下表情。所有内容都会同步保存在 MyDev 的 GitHub Discussions 中。</p></header>
  <section class="guestbook-shell" aria-labelledby="guestbook-title">
    <aside class="contact-aside"><p class="panel-label">CHANNEL_STATUS</p><dl><div><dt>Visibility</dt><dd>Public</dd></div><div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>GitHub</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>Discussions #1</dd></div></dl><p class="contact-note">留言将公开显示。请勿发布密码、Token、邮箱、电话号码或其他敏感信息。</p><a class="discussion-link" href="https://github.com/reuien/mydev-discussions/discussions/1">在 GitHub 中查看 ↗</a></aside>
    <article class="guestbook-panel"><div class="guestbook-intro"><div><p class="panel-label">LIVE_THREAD_01</p><h2 id="guestbook-title">Public guestbook</h2></div><span>GITHUB AUTH</span></div><p class="guestbook-help">登录后可以发表新留言，也可以回复和回应其他访客。首次使用时，GitHub 会要求你授权 Giscus 代表你发布评论。</p><div class="giscus"></div><noscript><p class="contact-note">请启用 JavaScript，或直接前往 <a href="https://github.com/reuien/mydev-discussions/discussions/1">GitHub Discussion</a> 参与留言。</p></noscript></article>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
<script is:inline src="https://giscus.app/client.js" data-repo="reuien/mydev-discussions" data-repo-id="R_kgDOUR664w" data-mapping="number" data-term="1" data-reactions-enabled="1" data-emit-metadata="0" data-input-position="top" data-theme="dark" data-lang="zh-CN" crossorigin="anonymous" async></script>
